Formation Anchoring: Units assigned to squads (Squads 1 through 4) maintain strict relative positioning around a squad leader or designated anchor (e.g., a "buddy" ship or heavy vanguard).

Shared Telemetry & Target Prioritization: Squad members share a closed-loop target scoring matrix. If a squadmate is taking heavy hull damage, light units (like Ion Disablers) automatically shift focus to suppress the attacker targeting that specific squadmate.   
