Disengagement Routing: Individual units evaluate retreat triggers independently (e.g., Assault Gunships fleeing at 0% shields) while maintaining squad cohesion for surviving members.

2. Battalion Mechanics (Macro-Operations)
Regional Command Hubs: Battalion Command Ships act as localized hubs, issuing operational orders and coordinating automated repair/resupply queues for all attached escort and support vessels within their 1,200m sensor bubble.   
